            <!-- ===== ABOUT ===== -->
            <section id="about" class="section section-about" aria-label="About Mahesh Makwana">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="section-header">
                        <span class="section-eyebrow reveal">Who I Am</span>
                        <h2 class="section-title reveal delay-1">About <span>Me</span></h2>
                        <p class="section-subtitle reveal delay-2">Python developer, open-source author, and trading bot engineer from Surat, India.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about__container">
                        <!-- Image -->
                        <div class="about__img-wrap reveal-left">
                            <div class="about__img-ring">
                                <img src="assets/img/about1.png"
                                     alt="Mahesh Makwana – Python Developer and Technical Lead, Surat India"
                                     width="300" height="300"
                                     loading="lazy"
                                     decoding="async">
                                <div class="about__img-badge">&#127470;&#127475; Surat, India</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="about__location">
                                <i class='bx bx-map-pin'></i>
                                Surat, Gujarat, India
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Text card -->
                        <div class="about__card reveal-right">
                            <h3 class="about__subtitle">Mahesh Makwana — Python Developer, PyPI Author &amp; Trading Bot Expert</h3>

                            <p class="about__text">
                                I'm a <strong>Python Developer</strong> specialising in <strong>back-end and full-stack development</strong>, currently serving as <strong>Senior Associate Technology at Publicis Sapient</strong>. With <strong>8+ years</strong> of hands-on experience, I have shipped production systems across ERP, data engineering, REST APIs, AI tooling, and financial trading.
                            </p>
                            <p class="about__text">
                                My core stack includes <strong>Python, Django, FastAPI, Odoo, Azure, Snowflake, Power BI</strong> and <strong>MySQL</strong>. I've led teams and delivered projects at <strong>HCL Technologies</strong>, <strong>TCS</strong>, <strong>Key Concepts</strong> and <strong>Comptech Infotech</strong>.
                            </p>
                            <p class="about__text">
                                I am an active <strong>open-source contributor</strong> and <strong>PyPI library author</strong>, publishing Python packages that solve real <strong>LLM integration, AI workflow automation</strong> and <strong>prompt engineering</strong> problems in production environments.
                            </p>
                            <p class="about__text">
